<title>SWEDEN: Electrolux falls after Q1 report.</title>
<headline>Electrolux falls after Q1 report.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish appliance maker Electrolux's shares fell sharply after first quarter results were announced.</p>
<p>The share fell 10 crowns to 463 crowns in light trade after the result. When the result was announced the share was unchanged on the day.</p>
<p>Electrolux posted a first quarter profit after financial items of 777 million crowns. Markets had expected a 910 million crown profit. -- Simon Haydon, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1004</p>
</text>
